(7629708, 1236480, 30364, '<td valign="top">This is irresistible for me.  So many possible dramas being played out in and around these shadows.  It''s a good example of the special magic of low-fidelity photography.  It''s so low-fi that it''s nearly a Rorschach test.  Some people - poor them - will see nothing in it.  Others will see everything in it. My own cup runneth over. 10. Thank you.</td>', 'This is irresistible for me.  So many possible dramas being played out in and around these shadows.  It''s a good example of the special magic of low-fidelity photography.  It''s so low-fi that it''s nearly a Rorschach test.  Some people - poor them - will see nothing in it.  Others will see everything in it. My own cup runneth over. 10. Thank you.', '2019-05-16 10:47:16.000000', NULL, 1),
(7629709, 1236492, 42733, '<td valign="top">My favorite in this challenge!</td>', 'My favorite in this challenge!', '2019-05-16 10:51:06.000000', NULL, 1),
(7629710, 1236262, 42733, '<td valign="top">Adorable!!</td>', 'Adorable!!', '2019-05-16 10:51:16.000000', NULL, 1),
(7629711, 1236459, 42733, '<td valign="top">In my top 3.</td>', 'In my top 3.', '2019-05-16 10:51:50.000000', NULL, 1),
(7629712, 1236304, 30364, '<td valign="top">Beautiful little drama.  I marvel at how the angled figure animates everything, and commands all the attention at first. But then one begins to wonder about the motives of the other three.  Are they surrounding her with malice?  Is the angled lady investigating a crime?  Is she about to become the victim of a crime herself?  There''s very few forensic clues on offer here.  Not a stray fibre nor a carelessly discarded French cigarette butt in sight anywhere. But the perpetrator is someone in that room.  It always is..  <br/> <br/>I feel better now.  Thank you. 9.</td>', 'Beautiful little drama.  I marvel at how the angled figure animates everything, and commands all the attention at first. But then one begins to wonder about the motives of the other three.  Are they surrounding her with malice?  Is the angled lady investigating a crime?  Is she about to become the victim of a crime herself?  There''s very few forensic clues on offer here.  Not a stray fibre nor a carelessly discarded French cigarette butt in sight anywhere. But the perpetrator is someone in that room.  It always is..   I feel better now.  Thank you. 9.', '2019-05-16 10:53:07.000000', NULL, 1),
(7629713, 1236222, 30364, '<td valign="top">Startling and beautiful.  I think this is a dune protection or rehabilitation project.  But you have made it an intergalactic outpost. The last hopeless attempt at survival. 8. Thank you.</td>', 'Startling and beautiful.  I think this is a dune protection or rehabilitation project.  But you have made it an intergalactic outpost. The last hopeless attempt at survival. 8. Thank you.', '2019-05-16 10:57:19.000000', NULL, 1),
(7629714, 1236320, 30364, '<td valign="top">Amazingly absorbing.  Unexpectedly lovely and satisfying.  It''s presumably a car door revealed, or some similar structure?  But it''s fabulously anthropomorphic, isn''t it?  Eye, nose, mouth. Anger or at least a howl of protest at something.  I went to a Picasso exhibition once and marvelled at his bicycle-saddle-and-handlebars bull on the wall.  Old Pablo might have been pleased and amused to have had this hanging next to his bike-bull.<br/> <br/>I certainly would have been pleased, as I am now. 8. Thank you.</td>', 'Amazingly absorbing.  Unexpectedly lovely and satisfying.  It''s presumably a car door revealed, or some similar structure?  But it''s fabulously anthropomorphic, isn''t it?  Eye, nose, mouth. Anger or at least a howl of protest at something.  I went to a Picasso exhibition once and marvelled at his bicycle-saddle-and-handlebars bull on the wall.  Old Pablo might have been pleased and amused to have had this hanging next to his bike-bull. I certainly would have been pleased, as I am now. 8. Thank you.', '2019-05-16 11:03:57.000000', NULL, 1),
(7629716, 1236278, 30364, '<td valign="top">This looks like a simple faux-tintype, but it''s quite a bit more than that, isn''t it? The extravagant vignette is perfect, but the reflected feet is the magic touch that elevates this photograph.  Plus, especially when viewed as a thumbnail, it''s an indignant face.  Love it. 8. Thank you.</td>', 'This looks like a simple faux-tintype, but it''s quite a bit more than that, isn''t it? The extravagant vignette is perfect, but the reflected feet is the magic touch that elevates this photograph.  Plus, especially when viewed as a thumbnail, it''s an indignant face.  Love it. 8. Thank you.', '2019-05-16 11:09:15.000000', NULL, 1),
(7629717, 1236229, 30364, '<td valign="top">A classic HCB kind of photograph. Lovely control of exposure and teasing-out of tones. Elegant composition.  Not quite startling enough for my taste, but it''s still good to the last drop, and I''d be glad to have a second cup. 7. Thank you.</td>', 'A classic HCB kind of photograph. Lovely control of exposure and teasing-out of tones. Elegant composition.  Not quite startling enough for my taste, but it''s still good to the last drop, and I''d be glad to have a second cup. 7. Thank you.', '2019-05-16 11:11:58.000000', NULL, 1),
(7629718, 1235980, 30364, '<td valign="top">The presence of the sidewalk sign board, like an extra pair of legs, elevates this.  The Something Wild is Coming adds another layer of welcome whimsy. But once past that marvellous juxtaposition and that wry prediction, it''s still a lovely photograph in its own right, from a light and tones point of view. 7. Thank you.</td>', 'The presence of the sidewalk sign board, like an extra pair of legs, elevates this.  The Something Wild is Coming adds another layer of welcome whimsy. But once past that marvellous juxtaposition and that wry prediction, it''s still a lovely photograph in its own right, from a light and tones point of view. 7. Thank you.', '2019-05-16 11:15:20.000000', NULL, 1),
(7629727, 1236423, 50695, '<td valign="top">you''re probably going to ribbon for this photo of someone else''s sculpture, but I must admit the treatment of it, the angle and the high contrast, are well done.</td>', 'you''re probably going to ribbon for this photo of someone else''s sculpture, but I must admit the treatment of it, the angle and the high contrast, are well done.', '2019-05-16 16:19:19.000000', NULL, 1),
